# Pass "avec-revues": shared tools used only for evidence a person reviews.
#
#   scripts/Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -Mod ArchitectStudio -DepMap wsl-deps.avec-revues.map `
#       -Filter '03-group-member-drag.feature,04b-arrows-at-150-percent.feature,16-language-review.feature'
#
# InterfaceScale repairs the current Workshop Pickle's coordinate conversion at 150%, so a
# screenshot review can exercise its real buttons. FilmTicks records the group-member reorder as
# a video: the scenario still asserts the callback's result, while the reviewer sees the actual
# rendered member rows change. Both companions are development-only and are never distributed.
nelim.pickletools.interfacescale path:PickleTools/InterfaceScale/Mod
nelim.pickletools.filmticks      path:PickleTools/FilmTicks/Mod
